      "refersTo": "review-stop",
      "description": "Queue row with marker, location, and reason.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-review\"><button class=\"ds-review-go\"><svg class=\"ds-review-mark\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M8 1L15 8 8 15 1 8z\"/></svg><span>Frame 42 \u00b7 Subject</span><span>62</span><span class=\"ds-review-why\">Check the matte edge at this frame.</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-review{padding:4px 6px 4px 4px;background:var(--panel-raised,#303033);border:1px solid transparent;border-bottom-color:var(--line,#3a3a3d);border-radius:0;color:var(--text,#f1f1f3)}.ds-review:hover{border-color:var(--gray-600,#5c5c61)}.ds-review-go{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--text,#f1f1f3);cursor:pointer;display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:2px 6px;width:100%;min-height:24px;padding:2px;border:0;background:transparent;text-align:left;font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-review-mark{color:var(--warning,#e8b339)}.ds-review-why{grid-column:2/-1;color:var(--text-muted,#aaaab0);line-height:1.45;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-review-go:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:1px;border-radius:6px}@media(pointer:coarse),(max-width:1023.98px){.ds-review-go{min-height:44px}}"
